BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hydra-hydra-town-dekapentavgoustos-at-the-cathedral-of-the-panagia-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dekapentavgoustos at the Cathedral of the Panagia\, Hydra Town
LOCATION:Hydra Town\, Hydra\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 17th-century monastery-cathedral of the Koimisis on the harbour front is Hydra's main church\, so 15 August is its name day: vespers on the 14th\, liturgy and a procession of the icon through the port streets on the 15th\, with the whole island in its best clothes. Peak season\, no cars and every room taken\, so book months ahead if you want to be there.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/hydra/#hydra-town-dekapentavgoustos-at-the-cathedral-of-the-panagia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/hydra/#hydra-town-dekapentavgoustos-at-the-cathedral-of-the-panagia
END:VEVENT
